{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲航天局（ESA）宣佈，其「赫拉」號（Hera）小行星探測器正在順利飛往雙小行星系統「迪迪莫斯-迪莫弗斯」（Didymos-Dimorphos），並將在未來抵達目標區域，對美國國家航空航天局（NASA）此前實施的人類首次行星防禦實驗進行全面調查。這項任務有望首次詳細揭示人造撞擊對小行星造成的長期影響，並為未來抵禦潛在近地天體威脅提供關鍵數據。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587344.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.067614+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:18:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"ebbb5d9abb72f5165bc2d5823f87b43438830bacd4fcda4315bdebdd0d9efd8c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}